<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<%- include('./../../common/header') %>
<head>
  <style>
    html, body { background: #000 !important; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    .stage {
      max-width: 480px;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* 상단 일러스트 */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center top;
      display: block;
      animation: heroIn 1.2s ease both;
    }
    @keyframes heroIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.06); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    }
    .hero-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 35%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 78%, #000 100%);
    }
    .hero-text {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0; right: 0;
      bottom: 34px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 24px;
      animation: fadeUp 1.1s ease 0.4s both;
    }
    .hero-text .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      color: #c9a84c;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
    }
    .hero-text h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.75), 0 0 30px rgba(192,57,43,0.3);
    }
    .hero-text h1 span { color: #c9a84c; }
    .hero-text p {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    }
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* 하단 CTA */
    .cta-area {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      background: #060000;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.18);
      padding: 30px 24px calc(30px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease 0.7s both;
    }
    .ready-msg {
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0 0 22px;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .ready-msg b { color: #c9a84c; font-weight: 700; }
    .result-btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px 0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.35);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b1a1a, #c0392b);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: inherit;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(192,57,43,0.4);
      animation: pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .result-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(192,57,43,0.35); }
      50%      { box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(192,57,43,0.7); }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="stage">

  <div class="hero">
    <img class="hero-img" src="/assets/images/tight/reunion/report_bg.png" alt="재회사주">
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-text">
      <span class="tag">R E U N I O N</span>
      <h1>재회<span>사주</span></h1>
      <p>더 늦기 전에, 다시 만날 수 있을까?</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-area">
    <p class="ready-msg"><b>재회 사주 리포트</b>가<br>완성되었어요!</p>
    <form id="resultForm" method="POST" action="/saju/reunion/preview">
<% Object.entries(typeof form !== 'undefined' && form ? form : {}).forEach(function (e) { %>
      <input type="hidden" name="<%= e[0] %>" value="<%= e[1] %>">
<% }) %>
      <button type="submit" class="result-btn">클릭하고 결과 보러가기</button>
    </form>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
